    "sections": {
        "description": "The Classic Beauty Parlour Theme is a modern, professional, and feature-rich solution designed for beauty salons, spas, parlours, wellness centers, makeup artists, hair stylists, skincare clinics, manicure and pedicure studios, facial treatment centers, and beauty service providers. Ideal for showcasing bridal makeup, professional hair styling, beauty packages, wellness treatments, spa therapies, salon promotions, and beauty product sales, the theme offers responsive, mobile-friendly, and visually appealing layouts to ensure an engaging user experience. Customizable sections allow for service listings, appointment bookings, galleries, testimonials, and promotional offers, while personalization options for fonts, colors, and layouts help reflect your brand identity. Built with SEO-friendly, clean, and optimized code, it improves visibility and performance across devices. Integration with plugins like WooCommerce enables selling beauty products, spa equipment, and treatment packages online, and Contact Form 7 streamlines client inquiries and appointment scheduling. Perfect for luxury salons or budget-friendly parlours alike, the Classic Beauty Parlour Theme provides a professional, interactive, and fully functional platform to promote beauty and wellness services effectively.Demo:https://live.theclassictemplates.com/beauty-parlour-pro/"
    },
